# Text files are LF in the working tree on every platform: the committed generated files (Assets.g.cs, ...) are
# compared byte for byte with what the tools write, and shell scripts must not get CRLF on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.iff binary
*.wav binary
*.bat eol=crlf
*.cmd eol=crlf
*.pdf binary
